    text: "Affected stops:\r\nColfax Ave & Broadway (#12849) (eastbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Sherman St (#12978) (eastbound)\r\n8th Ave & Logan St (#11862) (westbound)\r\n8th Ave & Sherman St (#22560) (westbound)\r\nLincoln St & 9th Ave (#17783) (westbound)\r\nLincoln St & 11th Ave (#17784) (westbound)\r\nLincoln St & 13th Ave (#14965) (westbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Broadway (#12850) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 6 get on/off buses at:\r\nBroadway & Cleveland Pl (#17730)\r\nGrant St & 14th Ave (#18999)\r\n\nFor westbound Route 6 get on/off buses at:\r\n8th Ave & Washington St (#11873)\r\n15th St & Cleveland Pl (#17698)"
